        "slide": 1,
        "role": "cover",
        "subject": "An off white robot wrist casting with a raised bolt-ring plate and a rounded joint housing, closed on a vertical drill pipe. Under it hangs a dark tool joint with an ember band and turned pin threads. The upper arm leaves the frame at upper right, with two soft mast lamps in the black above.",
        "visual_consequence": "A machine's gripper, not a hand, holds the pipe at the pin. The ember band marks that joint as machine-handled before any figure arrives.",
        "weakness": "At 100 percent the castings are clean, smooth rounded blocks. None of the planned die pads, cable loom or weather grime is visible. The pipe above the gripper is a soft blurred column with no tool joint detail. The band carries one smeared reflection streak but rolls off correctly at both silhouettes.",
        "repair": "none required for the audition. In the pixel pass, add the planned cable loom along the wrist and visible die pads at the jaw line.",
        "encoding_reads": true,
        "dominant_subject_finished": true,
        "feed_legible": true,
